{"posts":[{"id":"finddecision_p7_151","t":"PAST, APPROACH & REACTION\n\nwhere are","a":"—","d":"","n":"#151","p":7,"im":["153ff9a73889df50549793d1703270e190bab2d9","bacc7df2e3545da91044113ee28db992ee173242"],"m":151},{"id":"finddecision_p7_152","t":"PAST, APPROACH & REACTION\n\nwhere are","a":"—","d":"","n":"#152","p":7,"im":["e497a2d2b138660a8bd2b3d84f2370ee0736f8ca"],"m":152},{"id":"finddecision_p7_153","t":"PAST\n\nwhere are\n\nAPPROACH & REACTION","a":"—","d":"","n":"#153","p":7,"im":["278c209bf8a82d66736724939911c8771e51a60a","8bf8778adf91b152ca48f4457440aafa19b68284"],"m":153},{"id":"finddecision_p7_154","t":"PAST, APPROACH & REACTION\n\nwhere are","a":"—","d":"","n":"#154","p":7,"im":["818e179cc31a79da4e824ea50ecfd0290c6c6756","7df10ce56b797daa65ca2922466545b808c1c56e"],"m":154},{"id":"finddecision_p7_155","t":"PAST\n\nwhere are\n\nAPPROACH & REACTION","a":"—","d":"","n":"#155","p":7,"im":["37b8dfc1a6b6c869da7c235187d6a02d8178a249","b9e6626791f74ca924ff8e8f30ea3d3db42db4e6"],"m":155},{"id":"finddecision_p7_156","t":"PAST, APPROACH & REACTION\n\nwhere are","a":"—","d":"","n":"#156","p":7,"im":["e328d8c327486026aa80874d234a3385b3521b94","bd046b0a063c3c5872b8441d385cdd1bbdf6ce50"],"m":156},{"id":"finddecision_p7_157","t":"PAST, APPROACH & REACTION\n\nwhere are\n\n**Remember how at point 7 LTF DEMAND had been engulfed and this allowed price to come right down to the DAILY DEMAND here at 9.","a":"—","d":"","n":"#157","p":7,"im":["2ce72313f30a89e976c778df7b4b2cffd01e8c92"],"m":157},{"id":"finddecision_p7_158","t":"PAST, APPROACH & REACTION\n\nwhere are","a":"—","d":"","n":"#158","p":7,"im":["6ece39486c182bc6affa4d26a5bdb609c21ac5f3","6e4ed94494a3fcd4b0abd57e0f4f4e714c70f1f5"],"m":158},{"id":"finddecision_p7_159","t":"PAST, APPROACH & REACTION\n\nwhere are","a":"—","d":"","n":"#159","p":7,"im":["800741b89dfd598eca669ba83f463e603af57acc","dbd04d81f7ab7bfe70415b2db9a21a2483c9abec"],"m":159},{"id":"finddecision_p7_160","t":"arjfca\n\nHere is my first post and first homework\n\nIf possible, please comment and say if I'm on a right track\n\nMartin:)","a":"—","d":"","n":"#160","p":7,"im":["0598ee06172c70e52a99db8455be253cbd411853","6741030353c429c507d87c566ed8816a86c1e53e","606352321a83d52e0fdc8eb3bf0e95153bb61b79","4d032e94476eb4dd29c181b89806e29148972adb","f52c9eb7bb48790ddafcbdeba45888a6fd7f3bed"],"m":160},{"id":"finddecision_p7_161","t":"fxtiger\n\nHi Guys, I'm learning how to find the Decisions Point on the charts, any help would be appreciated... Here's a series of recent GU charts from D1 to M5, I wonder if I have found the true Decision point....\n\nThanks alot!","a":"—","d":"","n":"#161","p":7,"im":["e0ecf31124b450a3a05ffd5475242240bb1874b7","899bb5da8e853584043e80c168f0c6da793bb4e2","364a5c7dd83432fe6facdd1dfbbfb7e584520cc9","5bc70c3b474ffc05b447223552bf2534030a0fb1","e00c4894b7299ecb1ec762dc53fc7a562fee8296"],"m":161},{"id":"finddecision_p7_162","t":"Hello Martin,\n\nI am not familiar with the concept of WRB, will do some research.\n\nIn your third chart, to me it doesnt look like compression. Compression should have a wider range and more wicks on both sides, to put out orders and trigger SL´s.","a":"—","d":"","n":"#162","p":7,"im":[],"m":162},{"id":"finddecision_p7_163","t":"benhur\n\nRanganus wrote: Compression should have a wider range and more wicks on both sides, to put out orders and trigger SL´s.\n\nI am afraid this is a wrong definition for compression!\n\nA compression is where price move (usually crawls) in one direction while it keep retrace back to consume the last of orders left. Please refer to the compressionarticle inmarkepediafro better understanding readthemarket.com/index.php/education/ma...9-compression-part-1","a":"—","d":"","n":"#163","p":7,"im":[],"m":163},{"id":"finddecision_p7_164","t":"fxtiger wrote: Hi Guys, I'm learning how to find the Decisions Point on the charts, any help would be appreciated... Here's a series of recent GU charts from D1 to M5, I wonder if I have found the true Decision point....\n\nThanks alot!\n\n1510\n\nHi fxtiger:\n\nyour first question: yes, it is a lovely DP!\n\nyour second question: who knows...? It may bounce again or get engulfed. In the latter case a new DP will be formed\n\nLes_Paul","a":"—","d":"","n":"#164","p":7,"im":["e00c4894b7299ecb1ec762dc53fc7a562fee8296"],"m":164},{"id":"finddecision_p7_165","t":"ttfreitas\n\nThis is an awesome homework! I am having a go at the GBP/USD Daily. My LTF charts are 5min charts and they display the zones that price reacted to. The numbers in the LTFs have their counterpart in the Daily chart.","a":"—","d":"","n":"#165","p":7,"im":["8b577a8bb7026a6454a90df78f8ced9806c68927","f35ba7482ad51c3fcb91f09ca4c4bbf11091e00a","b3608c26998901b5c1563bb45547d5a8dc147803"],"m":165},{"id":"finddecision_p7_166","t":"Finding Decision Point (DP)\n\nPrice rallied up from indecision area n created a new Demand Zone (RBR). At around 1.383, price dropped around 290 pips. But why? Let's take a look what's on the left\n\nZoomed out. Let's zoom into that area on the left.\n\nThat's a nice supply area where banks decided to sell Euro against USD back in 9/11/2011\n\nCorrect me if i'm wrong or if there's anything i can improve on finding decision points and reading the market:)","a":"—","d":"","n":"#166","p":7,"im":["614b292544acfbf51c9a694f7747a0003f73b185","5faae27beb724ccdd7e0bbe80982a11c58fee6a1","41a4ae1214b6b907a3a8bfb59f9a385c03b15743"],"m":166},{"id":"finddecision_p7_167","t":"Gold H1\n\nMy attempt to read the chart and find decision points and areas.\n\nComments are most welcomed:)","a":"—","d":"","n":"#167","p":7,"im":["00ab58d152963511de97348ca16439d108e4cdd4"],"m":167},{"id":"finddecision_p7_168","t":"Is this correct??","a":"—","d":"","n":"#168","p":7,"im":["8c47dba5a96f067daf638683b2987510f94c8403"],"m":168},{"id":"finddecision_p7_169","t":"Hi Seniors, I have a query here.I have attached a screenshot,with DP marked.Can you please give your inputs.","a":"—","d":"","n":"#169","p":7,"im":["1028bbce83d22c5b63bfa62c79c907990212c9d0"],"m":169},{"id":"finddecision_p7_170","t":"dcabfx\n\nDecisions! Why did price react there? Price action clues and story. Okay, I've marked 20 turning points on a EU Daily chart. Went as low as I could in history to find relevant information for price reaction. Take a browse and any feedback is appreciated.","a":"—","d":"","n":"#170","p":7,"im":[],"m":170},{"id":"finddecision_p7_171","t":"dcabfx\n\nPoint 1.","a":"—","d":"","n":"#171","p":7,"im":[],"m":171},{"id":"finddecision_p7_172","t":"dcabfx\n\nPoint 2","a":"—","d":"","n":"#172","p":7,"im":[],"m":172},{"id":"finddecision_p7_173","t":"dcabfx\n\nPoint 3","a":"—","d":"","n":"#173","p":7,"im":[],"m":173},{"id":"finddecision_p7_174","t":"dcabfx\n\nPoint 4","a":"—","d":"","n":"#174","p":7,"im":[],"m":174},{"id":"finddecision_p7_175","t":"dcabfx\n\nPoint 5","a":"—","d":"","n":"#175","p":7,"im":[],"m":175}],"images":[{"k":"153ff9a73889df50549793d1703270e190bab2d9","t":"assets/thumbs/153ff9a73889df50549793d1703270e190bab2d9.webp","f":"assets/images/153ff9a73889df50549793d1703270e190bab2d9.jpeg","w":1058,"h":495,"b":30812,"o":"153ff9a73889df50549793d1703270e190bab2d9.jpeg","p":7,"pid":"finddecision_p7_151"},{"k":"bacc7df2e3545da91044113ee28db992ee173242","t":"assets/thumbs/bacc7df2e3545da91044113ee28db992ee173242.webp","f":"assets/images/bacc7df2e3545da91044113ee28db992ee173242.jpeg","w":1359,"h":500,"b":88398,"o":"bacc7df2e3545da91044113ee28db992ee173242.jpeg","p":7,"pid":"finddecision_p7_151"},{"k":"e497a2d2b138660a8bd2b3d84f2370ee0736f8ca","t":"assets/thumbs/e497a2d2b138660a8bd2b3d84f2370ee0736f8ca.webp","f":"assets/images/e497a2d2b138660a8bd2b3d84f2370ee0736f8ca.jpeg","w":956,"h":522,"b":47985,"o":"e497a2d2b138660a8bd2b3d84f2370ee0736f8ca.jpeg","p":7,"pid":"finddecision_p7_152"},{"k":"278c209bf8a82d66736724939911c8771e51a60a","t":"assets/thumbs/278c209bf8a82d66736724939911c8771e51a60a.webp","f":"assets/images/278c209bf8a82d66736724939911c8771e51a60a.jpeg","w":931,"h":534,"b":45183,"o":"278c2